xmodel/web-sweep-20260902-grok46.md:176:**Coordinator action.** Do not withdraw N\(\le 5\), the cusp/homology theorems, or the two curve kills. Queue F14 (Orevkov 2512.07986) and F15 (Kulikov 2503.07099) as the highest-value missed primary texts for a horn/A2 desk pass: local completeness of ramified germs over a one-characteristic-pair branch, *not* a U-bound and *not* a Keller identity. F1 (Schenk) remains the only external item that could, if sound, retire the campaign; still unaudited. Do not promote a U-bound from F19 or F20. Do not treat LA-MOKA as a SIROCCO replacement for residual curves.
xmodel/web-sweep-20260902-grok46.md:219:**Negative searches.** Char-0 plane Keller counterexample; valid JC2 proof on arXiv after 2026-07-01; new \(\mu=1\) affine-image dicritical theorem; Tokunaga/IT09-style \(S_n\) existence criterion for one-place polynomial curves; BLZ equality-case successor listing or forbidding \((9,6,4)\); SIROCCO 2026 release; published certified braid word for \((9,6,2)\) or \((9,6,4)\); weighted Mason–Stothers U-bound in terms of cusp weight \(e\); new Domrina–Orevkov classification; new Matysiak version; Schenk v2.
