`OPEN[TWOPOINT-D1ZERO]`. The same support rule is used for the five
non-zero-`δ_1'` kills; there `−δ_1' ≥ B` holds on the four Moh controls
(equality) and is looser on `(15,10;11;2)`, so those charts are supersets
and are **not** affected; not re-audited here.

