xmodel/td6-v89h12-allq-p12-full-normal-form-hostile-review-report-20260826.md:217:The number 17 is the number of distinct parameter monomials in `ALLQ_P12_FULL_NORMAL_FORM.tsv`: the empty monomial together with the 16 singletons `(6,)…(27,)` listed in Charge 6. It is not `dim(n)`. `P12_FULL_NORMAL_FORM_RESULT.md` lines 54–55 state this split explicitly. The R3 client never asserts 17 as a free count (lines 170–172 assert 38, 132, and 94). The H11 free-count erratum (`P12_FLAG_FREE_COUNT_ERRATUM.md` lines 5–9) and the H11 corrective review (SHA `4fd55fa3…`) are incorporated: H11 computed the empty-nonpivot coefficient over all 94 nonpivots set to zero, and its algebra does not change.
