xmodel/td6-v89h12-allq-p12-full-normal-form-hostile-review-report-20260826.md:255:For every one of the 94 free variables, H12 lines 231–238 solve `A p = -D e_j` and assert `A p + D e_j = 0` entry by entry in `E3[q]^{38}`. Local replay printed 94 `triangular_solve=free_*` lines, all with `max_q_degree=0`, then `all_free_directions_original_FIRST_replay=true`. AWS R3 stdout is the same. Every free-direction response is therefore q-independent; the constant solution is q-linear. That is a computed fact, not an imposed specialization.
