+# Order-Basis Full Necessary Over-Approximation Audit
+
+Date: 2026-09-04
+
+Status: skeleton opened. This report intentionally has no completion seal until the instrument repair, reruns, and controls are finished.
+
+## Scope
+
+Inputs are the frozen lane copies under `/tmp/jc2-lane.sA4mxQ/inputs`, mechanically checked from `xmodel/order-basis-full-gpt55-20260903.run.v2`.
+
+The audit repairs the general order-chart instrument so the emitted algebraic system is an exhaustive necessary over-approximation of Moh Theorem 1.2's `D_1` coefficient locus for descended two-point data, then rechecks:
