+| row | partition | `delta_1'` | full `h` | old image rank | `h` cokernel | max coefficient cokernel | diagnosis |
+|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|
+| `(25,15;21;2;k=2)` | `3` | `7/5` | 9 | 5 | 4 | 20 | (a) and (b) |
+| `(25,15;21;2;k=2)` | `2+1` | `7/5` | 9 | 5 | 4 | 20 | (a) and (b) |
